post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Pi scans no system path by itself. Add the shared extension root once and
restart pi:

  ~/.pi/agent/settings.json
    "extensions": ["/usr/lib/pi/packages"]

That one directory entry loads every Pi extension installed by pacman, this
package included.

Undo history lives in a private git repository outside your project, so `git`
must be on PATH (already pulled in as a dependency). The extension stays
inactive in your home directory and in folders that only contain several
repositories; to force it on, also set:
  { "workspaceHistory": { "enabled": true } }

/undo   rewind files + conversation to before the last operation
/tree   (or double Escape) jump to any point; choose whether files follow
/redo   reapply, /diff [n] inspect, /checkpoint save by hand
EOF
}
